# Optional file-based "no changelog needed" exemptions.
#
# The canonical way to declare an exemption is a PR-body marker line, e.g.:
#
#     changelog-exempt: tests — adds regression coverage only, no user-facing change
#
# If a PR author prefers a tracked file instead of a PR-body line, they may add
# `.changes/exemptions/<slug>.md` here with the category and reason. Either form
# satisfies the advisory `cargo xtask changelog check` disposition rule. This
# .gitkeep keeps the directory tracked when it is otherwise empty.
